  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xe4;dda Barnens Beredskapsstyrka (EST) sekonderar experter p&#xe5; skydd av  barn samt utbildning i katastrofsituationer till R&#xe4;dda                Barnen-alliansen, UNHCR samt UNICEF n&#xe4;r expertis efterfr&#xe5;gas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Save the Children Emergency Standby Team (EST) provides Child     Protection in Emergencies (CPIE) personnel in emergency contexts      within the Save the Children Alliance, UNHCR and UNICEF on request.   EST also includes expertise on education in emergencies.</narrative>
